  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate KIC Blue Economy ClimAccelerator in Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EIT Climate-KIC is looking to procure a service provider to deliver a virtual/online accelerator programme for blue economy start-ups, social enterprises and not-for-profits in the Pacific Islands. This opportunity has directly arisen due to Pacific Green Entrepreneurs Network (PGEN)&apos;s work in this space.This opportunity is strategic as it:1) Is aligned with the Pacific Regional Strategy&apos;s focus on the Blue Economy as an important thematic area to focus on;2) Is a natural expansion from the Pacific Greenpreneurs incubator &amp; accelerator, building on established in-country partnerships; and3) Brings in a new donor(s) (European Institute of Innovation &amp; Technology &amp; Irish Aid) for potential future funding of PGEN activities.</narrative>
  </description>
